{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Clod &amp; Desire</strong>, you play... absolutely no one. There\u2019s no main character, no plot twist, no enemy to defeat\u2014just you and your power to place benches and hydrangeas wherever your heart desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think of it as a love letter to ground textures, decorative stones, and the profound existential mystery of where to put a tree.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sculpt terrain like a bored god</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place plants with reckless artistic ambition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the sunset over your perfectly symmetrical hedge maze</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No goals. No stress. Just vibes and compost</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of landscape design, without the back pain or HOA complaints.<br><strong>Clod &amp; Desire</strong> is a quiet scream into the loamy abyss.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603330?t=1748340064","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603330/42dedcf4cb9e8885eb56d11b75e6e1c63e7a5895/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748340064","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603330/98e256b883e76d7e56c5c690672f2117950c11a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748340064","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603330/98e256b883e76d7e56c5c690672f2117950c11a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748340064","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Clod &amp; Desire</strong>, you play... absolutely no one. There\u2019s no main character, no plot twist, no enemy to defeat\u2014just you and your power to place benches and hydrangeas wherever your heart desires.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think of it as a love letter to ground textures, decorative stones, and the profound existential mystery of where to put a tree.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sculpt terrain like a bored god</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place plants with reckless artistic ambition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the sunset over your perfectly symmetrical hedge maze</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No goals. No stress. Just vibes and compost</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of landscape design, without the back pain or HOA complaints.<br><strong>Clod &amp; Desire</strong> is a quiet scream into the loamy abyss.</p>","developers":["Clio Universe Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603330/4862077dd7cc143d423b37e3a1a8d47d1076a382/header.jpg?t=1748340064","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3603330/2069543673/36a306d12bc2ad21e07acfa5e73fa9fe38c3527c/1750448473/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747617458","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3603330/2069543673/36a306d12bc2ad21e07acfa5e73fa9fe38c3527c/1750448473/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747617458","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3603330/2069543673/36a306d12bc2ad21e07acfa5e73fa9fe38c3527c/1750448473/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747617458","id":257141397,"name":"A short demonstration","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257141397/233d52945a921c0